---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout
  title="Research"
  description="Research topics pursued by the CAL-Pathfinder collaboration: dark matter, gravitational waves, and the experiment."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">CAL-Pathfinder</span>
      <h1>Research</h1>
      <p class="desc">
        Our program spans dark matter searches, high-frequency gravitational wave detection,
        and the development of quantum-limited lumped-element instrumentation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-3">

        <a href={`${base}/research/dark-matter/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Dark Matter &amp; Axions</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            The evidence for dark matter, the axion as a motivated candidate, and the
            detection principle underlying DMRadio.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/research/gravitational-waves/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Gravitational Waves</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            High-frequency gravitational wave detection via the inverse Gertsenshtein effect
            using the CAL electromagnetic pickup.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/research/non-proliferation/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Non-Proliferation</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            Coming soon.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/research/lumped-element-detectors/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Lumped-Element Detectors</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            How CAL-Pathfinder works: solenoidal LC resonator, SQUID amplifiers,
            and cryogenic readout. Includes experiment details, publications, and talks.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/research/quantum-sensing/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Quantum Sensing</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            Coming soon.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href={`${base}/research/bread/`} class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--blue);">Bread</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--gray-600);">
            Coming soon.
          </p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
